  "details": "1. Place the VRChat widget on the home screen of your Android smartphone.\n\n2. After tapping the VRCat or VRRat widget several times, a message mentioning the number of friends may appear, but it always remains at 0.\n\nI have logged in before with a sub-account that only had one friend (i.e., only my main account), but I am currently logged in with my main account which has many friends, so it's strange that it shows 0 friends.\n\n*For some reason, I couldn't attach the cropped image, so this is a screenshot of the entire home screen, but you can see the VRChat widget in the bottom right corner.",
